{"id":"b7915fc84100c80e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-set.md","title":"ZFC Comb5 Independent Set","display":"df-zfc-comb5-independent-set — ZFC Comb5 Independent Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comb5-independent-set — ZFC Comb5 Independent Set","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb5-independent-set — ZFC Comb5 Independent Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,E,A\">\\(V,E,A\\)</span> 为集合；此行的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是顶点集，不是集合宇宙</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:\\mathsf{Set}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S:\\mathsf{Set}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentSet}_S:\\mathsf{Set}^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentSet}_S:\\mathsf{Set}^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Set}\">\\(\\mathsf{Set}\\)</span> 为集合变量的元类型；此类型记号不表示顶点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}independent\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentSet}_S(V,E,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land A\\subseteq V\\land[A]^2\\cap E=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}independent\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentSet}_S(V,E,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land A\\subseteq V\\land[A]^2\\cap E=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph well-formedness condition excludes malformed edge sets; independence then means that no two-element subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is an edge.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S:\\mathsf{Set}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,E,A","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:\\mathsf{Set}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentSet}_S:\\mathsf{Set}^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}independent\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb5IndependentSet}_S(V,E,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Graph}_S(\\langle V,E\\rangle)\\land A\\subseteq V\\land[A]^2\\cap E=\\varnothing","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1380,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1656","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-set.md|58-df-zfc-comb5-independent-set]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["0dc79ccc1050ee64","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5582a281f15a33c2"]}